### RetroFlow — manual API requests
# Run from IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client, built in) or VS Code (REST Client extension).
# Start the app first: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
#
# Add a request here for every new endpoint, so the next developer can try it in one click.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

